<title>USA: Kennedy-Wilson buys shares from officer.</title>
<headline>Kennedy-Wilson buys shares from officer.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA MONICA, Calif. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kennedy-Wilson Inc said it acquired about 89,000 shares of common stock from a former officer and director in a private transaction.</p>
<p>It said the shares were valued at about $940,000.</p>
</text>
